
  TOWARD A PROOF OF THE DOUBLING-SPORADIC MOD-3 LAW
======================================================================

  STEP 1 [PROVED]  M(V*) >= 1/n via t=1/n witness (n=6..40): OK
  STEP 2 [VERIFIED]  M(V*) = max(1/n, P_2n-1) (n=6..40): OK
  STEP 3 [PROVED]  2n-4 == -3 (mod 2n-1): OK
  STEP 4 [PROVED]  pair reaches dist 2/(2n-1) <=> gcd(3,2n-1)=1 <=> 3 nmid 2n-1: OK

  STEPS 5-6 + LAW  [VERIFIED]
